# Model Weights Directory

Place your trained model checkpoints here:

- `resnet50_finetuned.pth` (245 MB) - Main model weights
- `resnet50_finetuned.pth.sha256` - Checksum file for verification

**Note:** Model files are not tracked in git due to size constraints.
Download from secure internal storage or train your own model using `train_model.py`.
